    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d850">

                <pb facs="0992" n="898" sameAs="frus:frus1896/pg898"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Terrell to Mr. Olney.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Pera</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1896-12-01"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">December 1,
                    1896</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>I have insisted, with no result, for the answers to the demand for indemnity.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Terrell.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
